WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.078 --> 00:00:31.414
I planted red bell pepper seeds today.

2
00:00:31.415 --> 00:00:36.147
First, I put the seeds in a pot.

3
00:00:36.148 --> 00:00:42.812
Next, I covered them with soil.

4
00:00:42.813 --> 00:00:55.846
Then, I watered them.

5
00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:59.212
This morning I checked the pepper pot.

6
00:00:59.213 --> 00:01:03.430
I didn't see anything.

7
00:01:03.431 --> 00:01:14.921
Are roots growing in the soil?

8
00:01:14.922 --> 00:01:18.670
Today I saw a green sprout!

9
00:01:18.671 --> 00:01:28.094
A tiny stem is poking through the soil. Yay!

10
00:01:28.095 --> 00:01:33.711
The stem gets taller each day.

11
00:01:33.712 --> 00:01:36.194
Leaves are growing.

12
00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:54.613
My pepper seedling looks strong.

13
00:01:54.614 --> 00:02:01.809
This morning I planted the seedling in the backyard.

14
00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:26.012
The sunny backyard is good for the plant.

15
00:02:26.013 --> 00:02:28.897
Today I looked at my pepper plant.

16
00:02:28.898 --> 00:02:33.094
I saw many small buds on it.

17
00:02:33.095 --> 00:02:43.940
Flowers will grow from those buds.

18
00:02:43.941 --> 00:02:47.471
Now flowers are blooming on the plant!

19
00:02:47.472 --> 00:02:58.021
The tiny white flowers are so pretty.

20
00:02:58.022 --> 00:03:02.030
Hmm. The flowers died quickly.

21
00:03:02.031 --> 00:03:09.874
But the plant has tiny green peppers!

22
00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:12.858
The peppers are changing color.

23
00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:15.962
Some are still green.

24
00:03:15.963 --> 00:03:24.278
But some are turning red!

25
00:03:24.279 --> 00:03:27.644
All my peppers are red now.

26
00:03:27.645 --> 00:03:31.518
That means they're finally ripe.

27
00:03:31.519 --> 00:03:39.915
I pick one and take a bite.

28
00:03:39.916 --> 00:03:45.807
Yum!
